For normal projectiles, take your current STR and divide by two
(rounding down). From this, subtract the weight of the projectile
divided by 40, rounded down.   The result is the projectile range.

Quivered ammunition used with the right launcher (bow/arrow, crossbow/
bolt, etc.) receives a one unit bonus.  But gems thrown without a
sling get half range as a penalty.

For heavy iron balls, use 100 instead of 40.

Giants always get a range of 20 when throwing boulders.  Mojo gets a
half range penalty.



